page('contact','Contact Trip Bhai','Email or call Trip Bhai, or prepare a travel enquiry. tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com · +44 7514 718031.',heading('CONTACT TRIP BHAI','Where would you<br><em>like to go?</em>','A few details are all we need to start the conversation. Please keep passports and financial documents out of your initial message.')+'''<section class="wrap section contact-grid"><aside><p class="eyebrow">SPEAK WITH OUR TEAM</p><h2>Let’s make<br><em>a start.</em></h2><a class="contact-link" href="mailto:tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com">tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com</a><a class="contact-link" href="tel:+447514718031">+44 7514 718031</a><p lang="bn">আপনার গন্তব্য ও ভ্রমণের পরিকল্পনা আমাদের জানান।</p><hr><h3>Already a client?</h3><p>Use the existing client portal for your account.</p><a class="text-link" href="'''+PORTAL+'''/client-login">Open client portal ↗</a><h3>Visits by arrangement</h3><p>Please confirm an appointment and meeting location with the team before travelling.</p></aside><form id="enquiry"><h2>Prepare your enquiry</h2><p>This form prepares an email on your device. You review and send it from your email app; nothing is submitted automatically.</p><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100"><label for="email">Your email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200"><label for="service">How can we help?</label><select id="service" name="service"><option>Visit visa enquiry</option><option>Flights and travel</option><option>Hotels and holidays</option><option>General enquiry</option></select><label for="destination">Destination</label><input id="destination" name="destination" required maxlength="100" placeholder="For example, Italy"><label for="dates">Approximate travel dates (optional)</label><input id="dates" name="dates" maxlength="100" placeholder="For example, March 2027"><label for="message">Tell us a little more (optional)</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="2000"></textarea><button class="button" type="submit">Prepare my email ↗</button><p id="email-status" role="status"></p><div id="email-preview" hidden><label for="prepared">Your prepared message</label><textarea id="prepared" rows="10" readonly></textarea><div class="actions"><a id="email-open" class="button">Open email app ↗</a><button id="copy-email" type="button" class="secondary">Copy message</button></div><p>Send to <strong>tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com</strong>. Your enquiry has not been sent yet.</p></div><noscript><p>Please email tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com or call +44 7514 718031 to start your enquiry.</p></noscript></form></section>''')
page('privacy-terms','Privacy & service terms','How Trip Bhai handles website enquiries and personal information, and the terms on which travel and visa enquiry services are offered.',heading('PRIVACY & SERVICE TERMS','Plain information.<br><em>No small print.</em>','How this website works with your information, and what you can expect when you make an enquiry with TRIP BHAI LTD.')+'''<section class="wrap section split"><div><h2>Privacy on<br><em>this website.</em></h2><p>This public website is a set of static pages. It does not set tracking cookies, run analytics scripts or store anything you type in your browser.</p><p>The enquiry form on our contact page does not send anything by itself. It prepares a message on your device which you review and send from your own email app to tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com. Until you send that email, we receive nothing.</p><p>When you email or call us, we use your contact details and the travel details you share to respond to your enquiry and, if you go ahead, to provide the agreed service. We ask you not to send passport scans, bank statements or other sensitive documents in a first enquiry. Sensitive documents are only requested through the separate client portal, which has its own privacy information.</p><p>You can ask us at any time what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it or ask us to delete it, subject to any records we must keep. Email <a href="mailto:tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com">tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com</a>.</p></div><div class="company-panel"><p class="eyebrow">DATA CONTROLLER</p><dl><dt>Company</dt><dd>TRIP BHAI LTD</dd><dt>Company number</dt><dd>16286072</dd><dt>Registered office</dt><dd>53 Blenheim Road, London, England, E6 3EG</dd><dt>Contact</dt><dd><a href="mailto:tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com">tripbhaiofficial@gmail.com</a><br><a href="tel:+447514718031">+44 7514 718031</a></dd></dl><p>Client portal users should also read the portal’s own <a href="'''+PORTAL+'''/privacy">privacy information ↗</a> and <a href="'''+PORTAL+'''/terms">service terms ↗</a>.</p></div></section><section class="wrap section"><h2>Service terms<br><em>in brief.</em></h2><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>An enquiry is not a booking</h3><p>Sending us an enquiry does not reserve a flight, hotel or holiday and is not an application to any embassy, consulate or government authority. We confirm availability, prices, supplier terms and next steps separately, in writing.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Scope and cost agreed first</h3><p>Before any paid work begins we confirm what the service includes, what it does not include and the fee. No fee, processing time or timescale is promised on this website.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>No guaranteed outcomes</h3><p>Visa decisions are made by the relevant authorities. We cannot guarantee an approval, and a past approval shown on our visa stories page is not a prediction for anyone else’s application.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>UK immigration advice</h3><p>UK immigration advice, choosing an application form and representation are not offered through this website. See our <a href="../uk-support/">service availability page</a>. Practical orientation support, where offered, is not legal advice, therapy or crisis support.</p></article><article><span>05</span><h3>Photographs and stories</h3><p>Client photographs are published only with the client’s permission. To withdraw a photograph or story, email us and we will remove it from the public site.</p></article><article><span>06</span><h3>Changes</h3><p>We may update this page as our services change. The version published on this website is the current one. Last reviewed: November 2026.</p></article></div></section>''')
